#!/usr/bin/env node

/**
 * Release-reproducible local renderer for Course 2's original abstract diagrams.
 *
 * These assets are explanatory process models. They intentionally do not
 * reproduce Codex, ChatGPT, an IDE, a terminal, GitHub, or any other product
 * interface. The visible provenance label is part of every rendered image.
 * The release checker rerenders into a private temporary directory and
 * requires all generated bytes to match the published assets exactly.
 */

